            "notes": "Take [Mixtape](item_95c95a51-50f2-4ae3-850b-e2947a95b1ce) - Probably the best Lucio power overall, it allows you to have speed boost active 70-80% of the time while maintaining heals, it enables you to do a fat burst of healing on your team which can catch the enemy team off guard. That being said, don't stress about how high your speed-healing ratio is, but speed should definitely be higher usually.\n\n**You need to make sure that you use the burst of healing well, don't waste it, but other than that feel free to spam smaller bursts of healing with it if you need to.**\n\nTake [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) - a pretty generic start, not much to say. Feel free to swap [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) if you don't think you will be getting healed much or if you plan to play more aggressively, deep into the enemy team.",
