            "notes": "Take [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) - allows you to help your team even if they dive, wander off or if you're up to no good dueling a soldier somewhere. I think this is a very good item whose impact is hard to judge. That being said, it's not always good- if you're playing in a ball, noone is diving or flanking it loses all of its value.\n\n\n**EXTRA CASH:**\nMix and match from the optional items, don't be afraid to experiment with items not listed here, though the ones listed are probably one of the most optimal.",
