            "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:29:36.619323+00:00",
            "notes": "Take [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) - essentially gives your boops an instant mini [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) Inspire, gives you more self-sustain for when you need it and scales with your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). Diving enemy backline or dueling becomes a lot easier. \n\n**OPTION 1:**\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) - extremely cost-efficient stat stick that gives you up to 25% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) when you hit shots with your weapon, which is relatively easy to do on [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768), who makes good use of the [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) as well since you want to be shooting all the time anyway. \n\n**The easier time you have landing shots into enemy team's comp, the better this item is.**\n\nAs with all things- this is not always a good buy, in some games landing shots is not a very easy task(e.g. they have a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) playing a barrier build), bringing the uptime of the [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) down significantly.\n\nwhich is where the next item comes in\n\n**OPTION 2:**\n[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) - 50 armor, 15% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) armor and effectively regenerate 17 armor per second for 10,000 cash. \n\nYou pick this item when you find yourself dying a lot and need survivability, when you want to make diving the enemy backline or dueling people a lot safer or when [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is not good in that given game.\n\n**EXTRA CASH:**\nMix and match from the optional items, don't be afraid to experiment with items not listed here, though the ones listed are probably one of the most optimal.",
