            "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:29:36.619323+00:00",
            "notes": "Take [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) - an extra boop in combination with [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) is very good. Both healing and killing becomes easier. So does booping people off the map.\n\n**OPTION 1:** [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) - a pure stat stick item, sadly the overhealth is useless on Lucio but that is not why you buy this anyway.\n\n**OPTION 2: ANTI-HEAL**\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) - for when the enemy team has a lot of healing, you easily apply it with your boops, which you now have 2 of. Particularly good into [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) as she has a lot of healing and is a great boop target anyway. Particularly bad into [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) since she cleanses it and is most likely running [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b). \n\n**OPTION 3: SLOW**\n[Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) - I buy this on rare occasions, mostly to make the enemy tank's life harder. Especially good into [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) and [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1). \n\n\n**EXTRA CASH:**\nMix and match from the optional items, don't be afraid to experiment with items not listed here, though the ones listed are probably one of the most optimal.",
